 "mailer_templates_magic_link_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\"><title>رمز الدخول</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F5F6FA;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">رمزك: {{ .Token }} · Your code: {{ .Token }}</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#F5F6FA\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px\">\n <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:480px\">\n  <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding-bottom:18px\">\n   <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td style=\"padding-left:10px\"><img src=\"https://unimate.my/logo.png\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" alt=\"UniMate\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:12px;border:0\"></td>\n    <td style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#0E1430\">يونيميت</td>\n   </tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px;padding:30px 26px;text-align:right;font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif\" dir=\"rtl\">\n   <div style=\"height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#2E5BFF;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#FFB547,#FF4F7B,#7C3AED);margin-bottom:22px\"></div>\n   <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#0E1430;margin-bottom:8px\">رمز الدخول</div>\n   <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:26px;color:#3B4466\">اكتب هالرمز بالتطبيق عشان تدخل حسابك:</div>\n   <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:26px 0\">\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:36px;line-height:44px;letter-spacing:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#2E5BFF;background:#EEF2FF;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 18px 14px 30px\">{{ .Token }}</div>\n   </td></tr></table>\n   <div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:22px;color:#6B7391\">الرمز بيخلص بعد 10 دقايق. إذا ما طلبته إنت، تجاهل هالإيميل، وما حدا بيقدر يدخل حسابك بدونه.</div>\n   <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;border-top:1px solid #E4E7F0;margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;color:#6B7391\"><b style=\"color:#0E1430\">Your sign-in code</b><br>Enter this code in the app to sign in: <b style=\"color:#2E5BFF;letter-spacing:2px\">{{ .Token }}</b>. It expires in 10 minutes. If you didn't ask for it, you can ignore this email.</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:18px 10px;font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#9AA1B8\">\n   يونيميت · جامعتك كلها بتطبيق واحد<br>\n   <a href=\"https://unimate.my\" style=\"color:#6B7391;text-decoration:none\">unimate.my</a> · <a href=\"https://unimate.my/privacy/\" style=\"color:#6B7391;text-decoration:none\">الخصوصية</a> · <a href=\"https://unimate.my/support/\" style=\"color:#6B7391;text-decoration:none\">الدعم</a>\n  </td></tr>\n </table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</body></html>",
 "mailer_templates_confirmation_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\"><title>أهلاً فيك بيونيميت 👋</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F5F6FA;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">رمزك: {{ .Token }} · Your code: {{ .Token }}</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#F5F6FA\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px\">\n <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width:480px\">\n  <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding-bottom:18px\">\n   <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td style=\"padding-left:10px\"><img src=\"https://unimate.my/logo.png\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" alt=\"UniMate\" style=\"display:block;border-radius:12px;border:0\"></td>\n    <td style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#0E1430\">يونيميت</td>\n   </tr></table>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px;padding:30px 26px;text-align:right;font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif\" dir=\"rtl\">\n   <div style=\"height:6px;border-radius:3px;background:#2E5BFF;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#FFB547,#FF4F7B,#7C3AED);margin-bottom:22px\"></div>\n   <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#0E1430;margin-bottom:8px\">أهلاً فيك بيونيميت 👋</div>\n   <div style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:26px;color:#3B4466\">اكتب هالرمز بالتطبيق عشان تفعّل حسابك:</div>\n   <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:26px 0\">\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:'Courier New',Courier,monospace;font-size:36px;line-height:44px;letter-spacing:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#2E5BFF;background:#EEF2FF;border-radius:18px;padding:14px 18px 14px 30px\">{{ .Token }}</div>\n   </td></tr></table>\n   <div style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:22px;color:#6B7391\">الرمز بيخلص بعد 10 دقايق. إذا ما طلبته إنت، تجاهل هالإيميل، وما حدا بيقدر يدخل حسابك بدونه.</div>\n   <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;border-top:1px solid #E4E7F0;margin-top:22px;padding-top:16px;font-size:13px;line-height:21px;color:#6B7391\"><b style=\"color:#0E1430\">Welcome to UniMate</b><br>Enter this code in the app to activate your account: <b style=\"color:#2E5BFF;letter-spacing:2px\">{{ .Token }}</b>. It expires in 10 minutes. If you didn't ask for it, you can ignore this email.</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:18px 10px;font-family:Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#9AA1B8\">\n   يونيميت · جامعتك كلها بتطبيق واحد<br>\n   <a href=\"https://unimate.my\" style=\"color:#6B7391;text-decoration:none\">unimate.my</a> · <a href=\"https://unimate.my/privacy/\" style=\"color:#6B7391;text-decoration:none\">الخصوصية</a> · <a href=\"https://unimate.my/support/\" style=\"color:#6B7391;text-decoration:none\">الدعم</a>\n  </td></tr>\n </table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</body></html>",
